{"id":"terrestre","lemma":"terrestre","pos":"adj","rank":4908,"glosses":["soil, earth","Earth"],"ipa":"/tɛ.ʁɛstʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/aa/Fr-terrestre.ogg/Fr-terrestre.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"terrestres"},"formAudio":{"terrestres":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-terrestres.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je ne crois pas aux extra-terrestres.","en":"I don't believe in aliens.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to believe","l":"croire"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"extra, additional"},null]},{"text":"L'éléphant est le plus grand animal terrestre.","en":"The elephant is the largest land animal.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"elephant"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"big"},{"g":"animal"},null]},{"text":"Les éléphants sont les animaux terrestres les plus gros du monde.","en":"Elephants are the world's largest land animals.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"elephant","l":"éléphant"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"animal","l":"animal"},null,{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"big, thick, fat"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"world"}]},{"text":"Les forêts recouvrent environ 9,4% de la surface terrestre.","en":"Forests cover around 9.4% of the earth's surface.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"forest","l":"forêt"},{"g":"to recover","l":"recouvrer"},{"g":"about"},null,null,{"g":"surface"},null],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]},{"text":"J'ai été kidnappé par des extra-terrestres.","en":"I was abducted by aliens.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"to kidnap","l":"kidnapper"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"extra, additional"},null]}]}